# Harness State

SSOT for run tracking lives under `.harness/` (not `.agents/tasks/`).

- `feature_list.json` — scope; do not mark done without verify.
- `progress.md` — handoff for the next session.
- `registries/page-lifecycle.registry.json` + `base-docs/platform/toolchain/PAGE-LIFECYCLE.md` — highest stage per route when present; `portal:gen` / `portal:remove` / `portal:lifecycle sync` update these.
- When a public command updates phase, record: command, files changed, verify ran or not, remaining blockers.

Host overlays (Antigravity `AGENTS.md`, Cursor always-apply rules) point here; they must not invent a second task tracker.
